# A bare entry as well as `**/.venv/`: the trailing slash matches directories only,
# so an absolute-path `.venv` symlink created for a git worktree was not ignored and
# was committed to main in 46bf2fa. Checking main out then replaced a real virtualenv
# with a symlink to itself.
.venv
